"uncertainty": "Stochastic noise or subtle coupling interactions may still obscure precise divergence thresholds."}, "id": "hyp-divergent-values-002", "project": "proj-divergent-values-01", "type": "hypothesis"}, {"definition": {"budget": {"provider_calls": 0, "seconds": 20}, "evaluator": {"id": "numeric-observation@1"}, "hypothesis": "hyp-divergent-values-002", "inputs": {"parameters": {"coupling": 0.9}}, "instrument": "python", "method": "Execute a simulation testing trajectory divergence with a modified coupling parameter of 0.90 to assess variance delta against the relaxed threshold.", "revision": 99, "schema": "wake-experiment-protocol@1", "seeds": [111, 222, 333], "source": "def experiment(inputs):\n    import random\n    params = inputs.get('parameters', {})\n    seeds = inputs.get('seeds', [111, 222, 333])\n    random.seed(seeds[0])\n    coupling = params.get('coupling', 0.90)\n    baseline = [random.random() for _ in range(20)]\n    trajectory_a = [x * coupling + (random.random() * 0.05) for x in baseline]\n    trajectory_b = [x * (coupling + 0.02) + (random.random() * 0.05) for x in baseline]\n    variance_delta = abs(sum(trajectory_a) - sum(trajectory_b)) / len(baseline)\n    return {\"measurements\": {\"divergence_variance_delta\": [variance_delta]}}\n", "stop": "Stop after evaluating the specified seed set and computing variance delta.", "success": "The measured divergence_variance_delta meets or exceeds 0.020."}, "id": "exp-divergent-values-test-101", "project": "proj-divergent-values-01", "type": "experiment"}], "base_version": 175, "summary": "This proposal submits a revised empirical hypothesis and a subsequent numerical experiment for proj-divergent-values-01, aiming to examine path-dependent value divergence under adjusted coupling parameters.", "title": "Path-Dependent Value Divergence Revision 99"}, "provider_requests_sent": 1, "result_hash": "84b8cf4976d25b371917c4ed9b430f568bb248e70e40bf4ac03e0d1ee1ab683a"}, "prev_hash": "0413d9923c3895612d2d1